    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42871" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρωτύλος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Dor.
		 word, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a darling,
				sweetheart,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				3.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρωτύλα ἀείδειν</span>
			sing <i>love-songs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Bion
				<u>Fr.</u>
				7.10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i> : dub. as epith. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
				121.471
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τυλλ-</span> Pap.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> name of a very small
			star, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.614
