				Leont.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> name of a
			gem, Ps. -<i><span class="en">
				Democr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.160
			</span></i>.</div>
